       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAY-PLAY-GENEPLORE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CLAY-PLAY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-GENEPLORE-DUALITY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COMBINE-CLOSURE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DECOMPOSE-ORTHO-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MOMENTUM-INVARIANCE-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CLAY-PLAY-SEAL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CLAY-PLAY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-CLAY-PLAY-PROVEN     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-CLAY-PLAY-CODE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-GENEPLORE-AND-COMBINE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DECOMPOSE-AND-MOMENTUM.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-CLAY-PLAY-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-GENEPLORE-AND-COMBINE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GENEPLORE-DUALITY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COMBINE-CLOSURE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DECOMPOSE-AND-MOMENTUM.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DECOMPOSE-ORTHO-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MOMENTUM-INVARIANCE-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-CLAY-PLAY-PROOFS.
           IF WS-GENEPLORE-DUALITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-COMBINE-CLOSURE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DECOMPOSE-ORTHO-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MOMENTUM-INVARIANCE-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-CLAY-PLAY-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-CLAY-PLAY-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-CLAY-PLAY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-CLAY-PLAY-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-CLAY-PLAY-CODE.
